+   * The operator asked for the badge to go back to zero on its own — walking to
+   * the phone to press "Acknowledge All" is not acceptable. So every alert is
+   * acknowledged automatically a few seconds after it is shown: the badge and
+   * the counters reset by themselves, and the same write is sent to the server
